# SHA-256 checksums for the AppImage packaging tools, used by tools/build_appimage.sh.
#
# linuxdeploy and linuxdeploy-plugin-appimage publish only a rolling `continuous`
# tag (and type2-runtime likewise), so these hashes change whenever upstream
# rebuilds. Pin them per release window: run the appimage.yml workflow (or
# build_appimage.sh locally) once, copy the "tool checksums" lines it prints
# below, and commit. The build verifies against any non-comment lines here and
# skips verification while this file has none.
#
# Format (one per tool, two spaces):
#   <sha256>  linuxdeploy-x86_64.AppImage
#   <sha256>  linuxdeploy-plugin-appimage-x86_64.AppImage
#   <sha256>  linuxdeploy-plugin-gtk.sh
#   <sha256>  runtime-x86_64
